{"id":"wb-7-1591","name":"冒水村摩崖造像","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"冒水村摩崖造像","text":"冒水村摩崖造像位于四川省仁寿县虞丞乡冒水村大佛沟，又名大佛沟摩崖造像。冒水村摩崖造像是生活式特写佛教造像的代表，有六龛共22尊以佛教造像为主、兼具儒家和川主李冰的雕像，有碑记一通，题记一处三则。其中最具代表性的就是3号龛《世尊讲法图》，俗称拈花大佛或虞丞大佛。2007年6月1日公布为第七批四川省文物保护单位。2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%86%92%E6%B0%B4%E6%9D%91%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F","revisionId":93099193,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93099193","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9ea32d89b6bc57c90b771eda.jpg","title":"冒水村摩崖造像国保碑.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%86%92%E6%B0%B4%E6%9D%91%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ef/%E5%86%92%E6%B0%B4%E6%9D%91%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Maoshui village cliff sculpture","width":320,"height":198}}